  "description": "AMOS is an AI-augmented CRM that compresses weeks of repetitive sales work into minutes. It handles the full top-of-funnel cycle — maintaining ongoing client conversations and automating personalized lead discovery, outreach, and cold calls — so teams can spend their time closing rather than on busywork.\n\nUnder the hood it is built as a microservices architecture spanning Python and Go services, with a JavaScript/Node.js and TailwindCSS frontend and a PostgreSQL data layer, deployed on AWS. Large language models from OpenAI and Google Gemini power its conversational and lead-generation features, while Twilio drives the automated voice and messaging outreach.",
